# Line endings
#
# The repo runs with core.autocrlf=true, so the index is LF and a Windows checkout is
# CRLF: that is what every other file already does.
#
# chatui/index.html and chatui/style.css were the exception — they were committed with
# mixed endings inside the same blob, so a Windows editor saving one of them produced a
# whole-file diff (358/337 and 419/402 lines) around a 21 and 17 line change. Declaring
# them text keeps the index LF and makes the diff show only what actually changed.
#
# Deliberately NOT `* text=auto`: re-normalising the remaining CRLF-index files
# (LICENSE, electron/laya/LICENSE, python-requirements.lock.txt and the
# scripts/*-source.json analysis inputs) would rewrite bytes that release and catalog
# tooling read. Scope the policy to the files that need it.
chatui/*.html text
chatui/*.css text
chatui/*.js text
